    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY – PLEASE DO NOT CALL THE OFFICE\r\n\r\nTo apply, please provide a short rental biography including information about who would be living in the property, your previous rental experience, and any references you may wish to provide.\r\n\r\nExceptional First-Time Letting – 2 Bedroom, 2 Bathroom Ground Floor Apartment\r\n\r\nJeremy Murphy & Associates are delighted to present this exceptional first-time letting to the rental market. Located within the prestigious Estuary Court development on the sought-after Rochestown Road, this beautifully presented ground-floor apartment offers modern, comfortable living in a secure and highly desirable setting.\r\n\r\nFinished to an excellent standard throughout, the property features a stylish fully fitted kitchen complete with premium integrated appliances, a new high-efficiency gas boiler, underfloor heating, and Wi-Fi-enabled heating controls for maximum comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nThe spacious accommodation comprises:\r\n•\tWelcoming entrance hall\r\n•\tBright dual-aspect open-plan kitchen, living, and dining area\r\n•\tTwo generous double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\r\n•\tMaster bedroom with en-suite bathroom\r\n•\tContemporary main family bathroom\r\n\r\nThe property is offered fully furnished and is ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n•\tSecure, gated residential development\r\n•\tBeautiful water views overlooking the surrounding estuary\r\n•\tOne designated private parking space\r\n•\tUnderfloor heating with smart Wi-Fi controls\r\n•\tNew high-efficiency gas boiler\r\n•\tPremium integrated kitchen appliances\r\n•\tJust 260 metres from bus services (Routes 207, 216 & 223) providing easy access to Cork City Centre\r\n•\tOnly 5 minutes from Douglas Village, offering two shopping centres, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, bars, and a wide range of local amenities\r\n•\tExcellent connectivity via the South Link Road\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to rent a high-quality apartment in one of Cork's most desirable residential developments.\r\nStrictly no pets permitted."
      },
